## Species
wg-protean-species-name = Protean
wg-protean-species-summary = A swarm of machines around one solid seed. Fragile, hard to kill for good, and able to grow a working suit out of its own body.
wg-protean-speech-verb = hums
wg-protean-examine-hurt-light = Their surface is pitted and slow to close.
wg-protean-examine-hurt-medium = Parts of them are running like wax.
wg-protean-examine-hurt-heavy = They are barely holding a shape.

## Nanomass
wg-protean-mass-alert-name = Nanomass
wg-protean-mass-alert-desc = How much of you there is. Your nanomass fuels your shape, your healing, your plates and your modules. Absorb materials to replenish it.
wg-protean-mass-low-name = Running thin
wg-protean-mass-low-desc = You are almost out of nanomass. You are slowing down and your plates have shut off. Absorb something.
wg-protean-mass-starving = You are coming apart. Find material now.
wg-protean-absorb-verb = Absorb
wg-protean-absorb-self = You draw { $item } into yourself.
wg-protean-absorb-others = { $user } draws { $item } into their body.
wg-protean-absorb-full = You cannot hold any more.
wg-protean-absorb-refuse-living = Something in you refuses. That is alive.
wg-protean-absorb-refuse-container = Empty that first before you munch on it!
wg-protean-absorb-refuse-owned = That's got DRM built in, which tastes disgusting. Your mass refuses it.
wg-protean-fed-self = { $user } feeds you { $item }. You knit together.
wg-protean-fed-user = You press { $item } into { $target }. Their surface closes over it.
wg-protean-slurry-name = nanite slurry
wg-protean-slurry-desc = Grey, faintly glittering sludge. It was part of someone a moment ago.
wg-protean-slurry-reclaim = You take back what you lost.
wg-protean-emp = Static tears through you. Everything goes loose.
wg-protean-trace-glass-name = Limber
wg-protean-trace-glass-desc = You change shape and shift plates faster.
wg-protean-trace-plasteel-name = Hardened
wg-protean-trace-plasteel-desc = You are less fragile than usual.
wg-protean-trace-conductive-name = Conductive
wg-protean-trace-conductive-desc = Your modules draw less.
wg-protean-trace-plasma-name = Surging
wg-protean-trace-plasma-desc = You heal fast and catch fire easily.
wg-protean-trace-uranium-name = Self-sustaining
wg-protean-trace-uranium-desc = Your upkeep is lower. You glow a little.

## Ported from Meridian Rift
wg-protean-emp-light = Your nanites feel fuzzy and slow to answer.
wg-protean-mass-full = You are all there again.

## The seed, named here because the body already carries it
wg-protean-core-name = protean seed
wg-protean-core-desc = The one solid part of a Protean. Everything else can be replaced.

## Augments
wg-protean-augments-tab = A Protean has no fixed parts to replace. Augments do not take.
wg-protean-autosurgeon-refuse = The machine finds nothing to cut. { $target }'s body closes around the tools.
wg-protean-surgery-refuse = There is nothing here to operate on. They're just... Goo.

